WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:03.469
-It is time for
"Tonight Show Hashtags."

00:00:03.469 --> 00:00:05.505
-♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:07.807 --> 00:00:11.477
♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:11.477 --> 00:00:14.680
-We do this thing every week
where I send out a hashtag

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:16.749
and I ask you guys
to respond to that topic.

00:00:16.749 --> 00:00:19.619 line:0%
So, this week, I sent out
the hashtag, #MyWorstCar,

00:00:19.619 --> 00:00:21.921 line:0%
and we asked you guys to tell us
a weird or funny story

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:23.989 line:0%
about a bad car that you owned.

00:00:23.989 --> 00:00:25.759 line:0%
Within minutes,
it was a trending topic

00:00:25.759 --> 00:00:27.626 line:0%
in the U.S. for a long time.

00:00:27.626 --> 00:00:29.796 line:0%
So thank you so much
for playing along again.

00:00:29.796 --> 00:00:31.798 line:0%
It's fun for us.

00:00:31.798 --> 00:00:34.234 line:0%
The hashtag was #MyWorstCar,

00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:36.869 line:0%
and so people were just all
talking about their worst car.

00:00:36.869 --> 00:00:39.038
But what I found from
reading all of these,

00:00:39.038 --> 00:00:42.708
really, a lot of them --
many of them ended with,

00:00:42.708 --> 00:00:46.345
"I loved that car" or
"I miss that car."

00:00:46.345 --> 00:00:48.114
So, these are tweets -- This is
more of a salute

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:50.449
to all the cars out there
that we love and miss.

00:00:50.449 --> 00:00:52.352
So now I thought I'd share
some of my favorite

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:54.754
#MyWorstCar responses
from you guys.

00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:57.757
This first one's from
@taradublinrocks.

00:00:57.757 --> 00:00:58.792
She says...

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:13.739
[ Laughs ]
"Mr. Potato Car."

00:01:13.739 --> 00:01:16.442
That's a good idea for a toy.

00:01:16.442 --> 00:01:19.913
This one's from @pyokes.
He says...

00:01:29.122 --> 00:01:33.426
Ford Escape.

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:37.263
This one's from @Mamalafafala.

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:39.299
-What?
-She says...

00:01:54.914 --> 00:01:57.884
That's so --
That's so "Mario Kart."

00:01:57.884 --> 00:02:01.988
That's so fun.
This one's from @nevertrev.

00:02:04.257 --> 00:02:05.257
"Hey, Trev,
you want go out tonight

00:02:05.257 --> 00:02:06.259
and get something to eat?

00:02:06.259 --> 00:02:07.760
-Never.

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:11.998
-I understand. We're cool, man.
He says...

00:02:20.406 --> 00:02:22.275
"Hey, I think it's raining."
♪♪

00:02:22.275 --> 00:02:25.077
"Hey, Fabio, it's not raining.
It's fine."

00:02:25.077 --> 00:02:26.879
"Are you sure?

00:02:26.879 --> 00:02:29.215
Let me just wipe
the windshield."

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:30.849
-♪ Oh, yeah ♪

00:02:30.849 --> 00:02:31.917
♪ Windshields ♪

00:02:31.917 --> 00:02:35.588
-"Someone's under arrest."
"What?"

00:02:37.423 --> 00:02:42.361
"Trevor, do you want to
give me a ride to school?"

00:02:42.361 --> 00:02:46.131
-Never.
♪♪

00:02:46.131 --> 00:02:50.003
-This one's from @bekahjonelson.
She says...

00:02:59.645 --> 00:03:04.283
"Why did you order
the fire sauce?"

00:03:04.283 --> 00:03:07.187
This one's from @NBRieth.
She says...

00:03:17.162 --> 00:03:20.599
-What?
-So you -- What?

00:03:20.599 --> 00:03:24.837
Gas with your left and then --
What is going on?

00:03:24.837 --> 00:03:27.306
That sounds good.
This one's from @kimyarbrough.

00:03:27.306 --> 00:03:28.341
She says...

00:03:39.085 --> 00:03:40.619
Yeah.

00:03:40.619 --> 00:03:42.621
Fier-r-ro.

00:03:42.621 --> 00:03:46.759
This one's from @sarah schaefer.
She says...

00:03:56.102 --> 00:03:57.803
-Wait a minute.
How do you figure that out?

00:03:57.803 --> 00:03:59.739
That's what I was going to say.
How did you figure that out?

00:03:59.739 --> 00:04:01.741
"That's how much time
we spent in our car."

00:04:01.741 --> 00:04:06.979
They're like, "Whoa!
I could turn the horn off."

00:04:06.979 --> 00:04:09.882
This one's from @LaurelVerchuk.
She says...

00:04:16.822 --> 00:04:18.858
Pretty good. That's good.

00:04:18.858 --> 00:04:22.895
This one's from @mmklintworth.
She says...

00:04:25.230 --> 00:04:26.466
Here's a video.

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:32.738
[ Laughing ] Oh, my God!

00:04:32.738 --> 00:04:34.240
"We need gas.
No, we're full.

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:36.042
Now we need gas.
No, we're going 150."

00:04:36.042 --> 00:04:38.244
-Yeah.

00:04:38.244 --> 00:04:40.079
-This last one's from
@reneejordan78.

00:04:40.079 --> 00:04:41.114
She said...

00:04:47.486 --> 00:04:48.654
There you have it.

00:04:48.654 --> 00:04:50.089
Those are
"Tonight Show Hashtags."

00:04:50.089 --> 00:04:51.590 line:0%
To check out more of
